%% UI-05 · Write path — form submit → mutate revalidation
%% Source: components/*/*Form.tsx, *Dialog.tsx, pages/*, CompanySwitcher.tsx
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant D as Dialog / Form (RHF + zod)
  participant API as lib/api
  participant S as Server /api
  participant SWR as SWR cache
  participant T as sonner toast

  U->>D: fill fields, submit
  D->>D: zodResolver validates, isSubmitting = true
  alt invalid
    D-->>U: field-level errors
  else valid
    D->>API: api.post / put / patch / delete
    API->>S: request (Authorization: Bearer)
    alt server refuses (4xx/5xx)
      S-->>API: error, code, details
      API-->>D: rejects
      D->>API: toFailure(err, fallback)
      API-->>D: RequestFailure (code + details)
      D->>T: toast.error(message + shortfallLine)
      D->>D: keep form open, clear isSubmitting
    else success
      S-->>API: data
      API-->>D: data
      D->>SWR: mutate(listKey) — refetch the list
      SWR-->>D: fresh rows
      D->>T: toast.success(...)
      D->>D: close dialog (or navigate on a full page form)
    end
  end
  Note over SWR: Company switch is the exception:<br/>useSWRConfig().mutate(() => true)<br/>then window.location.reload()
